For the ellipse $C$: $\dfrac{x^{2}}{a^{2}} + \dfrac{y^{2}}{b^{2}} = 1$ $(a > b > 0)$, let the left vertex be $A$, the right focus be $F$, the top vertex be $B$, and the bottom vertex be $C$. If the intersection of line $AB$ and line $CF$ is $(3a, 16)$,  
