$(2)$ Let $b_n = \log_{3}(1-S_{n+1})$ for $n \in \mathbb{N}^*$, find the value of the positive integer $n$ that satisfies the equation $\frac{1}{b_1b_2} + \frac{1}{b_2b_3} + \cdots + \frac{1}{b_nb_{n+1}} = \frac{25}{51}$.

