Four students and two teachers are taking a commemorative photo together. How many different seating arrangements are there for each of the following cases? (Please provide numerical answers)
(1) The teachers must sit in the middle;
(2) The teachers cannot sit at the ends, but must sit together;
(3) The teachers cannot sit at the ends, nor can they sit adjacent to each other.

